1585
01:15:40,487 --> 01:15:42,127
"Right." Like this.

1586
01:15:43,057 --> 01:15:45,297
No?

1587
01:15:46,257 --> 01:15:48,597
"What are you up to?" Doesn't it sound like this?

1588
01:15:53,237 --> 01:15:59,577
