had those eyes when he looked at Ye Ji.

1604
01:17:00,543 --> 01:17:04,383
- He peeked at her like this.
- Right.

1605
01:17:04,383 --> 01:17:07,183
- But he just peeked at Na Young.
- Right.

1606
01:17:07,183 --> 01:17:09,053
Right. This is how Seon Ho looks at someone...

1607
01:17:09,053 --> 01:17:10,753
