1608
01:17:11,053 --> 01:17:12,693
- Right. Like this.
- But when he's interested...

1609
01:17:12,693 --> 01:17:14,823
He has a certain smile when he's interested in someone.

1610
01:17:14,823 --> 01:17:15,823
Right.

1611
01:17:16,493 --> 01:17:17,833
