1618
01:17:29,673 --> 01:17:31,943
Gosh, DK lost his cool after six episodes.

1619
01:17:31,943 --> 01:17:32,943
He lost his cool.

1620
01:17:32,943 --> 01:17:34,543
- He stayed calm until now.
- He stayed calm until now.

1621
01:17:34,543 --> 01:17:36,443
- He let it all out.
- He let it all out.

1622
01:17:40,113 --> 01:17:44,553
(A flash of excitement spreads between the shiny lights.)

1623
01:17:45,528 --> 01:17:50,628
(Their date carries on through the night.)

1624
01:17:57,908 --> 01:18:02,578
