- Really?

1639
01:18:40,853 --> 01:18:42,193
- Of course.
- I didn't want to grab too tight.

1640
01:18:42,193 --> 01:18:43,453
- It's fine.
- Thanks.

1641
01:18:43,453 --> 01:18:44,893
