1669
01:20:25,679 --> 01:20:26,709
Right.

1670
01:20:31,645 --> 01:20:33,875
I don't know much about sake. What should we get?

1671
01:20:33,875 --> 01:20:36,015
Then... Let's see.

1672
01:20:37,075 --> 01:20:39,485
(Very close)

1673
01:20:41,315 --> 01:20:42,855
(Checking)

1674
01:20:45,625 --> 01:20:47,585
(Checking)

1675
01:20:50,245 --> 01:20:51,645
Why isn't anyone talking?

1676
01:20:51,645 --> 01:20:53,375
