1680
01:21:00,115 --> 01:21:03,725
Se Young! We won't be able to carry on like this.

1681
01:21:03,725 --> 01:21:05,325
Right. This is quite awkward.

1682
01:21:05,325 --> 01:21:08,295
We're here as panelists, Se Young.

1683
01:21:08,395 --> 01:21:09,595
We're the MCs.

1684
01:21:09,595 --> 01:21:11,735
We won't be able to carry on like this.

1685
01:21:11,935 --> 01:21:13,835
Gosh, I was so surprised.

1686
01:21:13,835 --> 01:21:15,705
Gosh, this is hilarious!

1687
01:21:16,005 --> 01:21:19,805
All right, everyone. Let's take two deep breaths.

1688
01:21:19,905 --> 01:21:20,974
