1695
01:21:39,359 --> 01:21:40,859
- All of them.
- Really?

1696
01:21:40,859 --> 01:21:42,929
Yes. They serve the drink warm...

1697
01:21:43,289 --> 01:21:44,389
if you ask.

1698
