1727
01:23:13,645 --> 01:23:15,275
- It's good.
- It's nice, isn't it?

1728
01:23:15,275 --> 01:23:16,775
The scent will come up.

1729
01:23:17,515 --> 01:23:19,415
I feel relieved.

1730
01:23:20,045 --> 01:23:24,115
It doesn't smell as strong as soju.

1731
01:23:24,115 --> 01:23:25,125
Right.

1732
01:23:25,485 --> 01:23:26,785
