1739
01:23:41,799 --> 01:23:43,829
(Gazing)

1740
01:23:45,253 --> 01:23:47,853
- Wait. Give me a moment.
- What is it?

1741
01:23:47,853 --> 01:23:49,083
Why is Seon Ho acting so cute?

1742
01:23:49,083 --> 01:23:50,553
He's acting cute right now.

1743
01:23:50,553 --> 01:23:51,553
"Whoosh."

1744
01:23:51,853 --> 01:23:54,253
- "Whoosh! Nunang!" - Like this.

1745
01:23:54,253 --> 01:23:56,293
