1746
01:23:56,293 --> 01:23:59,033
It seems like Seon Ho is interested in her, right?

1747
01:23:59,133 --> 01:24:00,493
- That's what it seems like!
- Right?

1748
01:24:00,493 --> 01:24:01,633
What do we do?

1749
01:24:04,133 --> 01:24:05,503
- What do we do?
- Gosh!

1750
01:24:10,495 --> 01:24:11,765
(Swallowing)

1751
01:24:12,595 --> 01:24:13,665
(Blowing out)

1752
01:24:14,535 --> 01:24:17,365
That was so unnatural.

1753
01:24:17,635 --> 01:24:18,635
That was...

1754
01:24:19,435 --> 01:24:21,335
