- Why aren't they coming back?
- I wonder.

1761
01:24:38,652 --> 01:24:40,882
Didn't they meet up quite late?

1762
01:24:40,882 --> 01:24:42,852
Right. They did meet up quite late.

1763
01:24:44,522 --> 01:24:47,822
It was okay at first, but time kept going by.

1764
01:24:47,822 --> 01:24:50,892
It made me feel anxious.

1765
01:24:50,892 --> 01:24:52,792
It didn't just feel like they were coming back late.

1766
01:24:52,792 --> 01:24:55,762
They didn't come back even when it was late at night.

1767
01:24:56,562 --> 01:24:59,602
