1770
01:25:04,202 --> 01:25:05,372
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

1771
01:25:12,712 --> 01:25:13,752
It's so good.

1772
01:25:13,882 --> 01:25:15,382
Can I put my chopsticks in?

1773
01:25:15,482 --> 01:25:17,452
Sure. You already did.

1774
01:25:20,122 --> 01:25:22,092
I already did, but I wanted to keep my manners.

1775
01:25:22,092 --> 01:25:24,122
Okay. I get what you mean.

1776
01:25:34,972 --> 01:25:36,572
During that time,

1777
01:25:37,272 --> 01:25:38,812
