1804
01:27:21,129 --> 01:27:23,299
- That can't happen.
- What was that last part?

1805
01:27:23,299 --> 01:27:24,769
- What was that?
- What was that?

1806
01:27:24,769 --> 01:27:25,939
Hold on. I can't go home like this.

1807
01:27:25,939 --> 01:27:27,499
Is it okay to do that?

1808
01:27:28,439 --> 01:27:32,939
