1813
01:27:48,859 --> 01:27:50,329
(Gosh, I'm feeling tipsy.)

1814
01:27:50,329 --> 01:27:51,389
(Are you interested now?)

1815
01:27:51,389 --> 01:27:52,399
(I'm interested.)

1816
01:27:53,359 --> 01:27:55,329
(Seon Ho starts to fall for Na Young.)

1817
01:27:56,169 --> 01:27:59,569
